pattern_id	ere	note
A-P01	objects\.get\(	Django ORM 按 id 直查(本类第一锚)
A-P02	get_object_or_404\(	Django 快捷取对象
A-P03	\.get\(.*[Ii]d	dict.get/SQLAlchemy query.get 按 id 取
A-P04	get_by_id\(	服务层/仓储层 get_by_id 族
A-P05	filter_by\(	SQLAlchemy 键形谓词(属主列缺席由五步判)
A-P06	\.delete\(	Django queryset/session 删除(本类第二锚)
A-P07	update.*[Ii]d	按 id 定位的更新
A-P08	\.remove\(	内存注册表/缓存逐出族
